export anchor RingBinderStyle:
    number: 115
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Ring binder
    idea: The dashboard is the first sheet in a team ring binder, with coloured index tabs for navigation, punched holes and every panel slipped into a clear sheet protector.
    base: light
    palette:
        desk: #e1e4e7, the page and the punched holes
        coverNavy: #22375a, the binder spine, decorative only
        sheet: #ffffff, paper, the current tab and fields
        sleeve: #d6e6f5, sheet protector tint at 28 percent with a diagonal gloss
        ink: #1f2328, text and heavy rules
        muted: #545b63, captions, codes and the last week line
        officeBlue: #1d4f91, the primary button, meters, this week line and focus
        green: #1f6b3a, the On track sticker with a dot
        amber: #8a5300, the At risk sticker with a triangle
        red: #b42318, the Behind sticker with a square and overdue text
        tabYellow: #f6d55c, an index tab and summary tab
        tabBlue: #9cc3ef, an index tab and summary tab
        tabGreen: #a6d9a8, an index tab and summary tab
        tabPink: #f3a6b8, an index tab and summary tab
        tabOrange: #f7b77a, an index tab
        tabLilac: #c9b6ec, an index tab
        graphGrid: #d7e6f2, 16px squares behind the chart
    type:
        Three stacks. Head is Franklin Gothic Medium, Franklin Gothic, ITC
        Franklin Gothic, Arial Narrow, Arial, sans-serif. Body is Verdana,
        DejaVu Sans, Geneva, sans-serif. Mono is ui-monospace, Menlo,
        Consolas, monospace for codes, dates and counts. Sizes are 30px
        head greeting, 40px head summary figures, 22px head section title,
        19px head sleeve titles, 15px head tab labels, 13px Verdana body
        and 11 to 12px mono.
    layout:
        An open binder in three columns. On the left a navy spine carries a
        vertical brand label and three metal rings that reach into the
        sheet. In the middle a white sheet has three punched holes down a
        72px left margin with a dashed guide line. On the right six
        coloured index tabs stick out of the sheet edge as the navigation,
        the current Home tab white and pulled forward with a blue dot. The
        sheet header reads Section 1, Home with a mono line Brightwork team
        binder, sheet 1 of 6, then the search, a blue New project button,
        the bell and the user, over a 2px ink rule. The greeting and date
        sit on one line with a red overdue line under them. Four white
        divider cards each carry a small coloured tab on top with the
        figure inside. The projects table sits inside a sheet protector
        with a thumb notch at the top. Below, two protectors side by side
        hold a graph paper sheet with a week on week line chart, last week
        dashed grey with hollow squares and this week solid blue with dots,
        and a printed activity log with mono times. Below 760px the spine
        turns into a top band with rings along its lower edge, tabs move
        above it as a wrapping row of top tabs, and the holes run across the
        top of the sheet.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 22px between sleeves, an 18px sleeve inset and a 72px left gutter for the holes.
    density: Office dense. Small Verdana, 10px table rows, everything filed on one sheet.
    corners: Square paper. Tabs round 10px on the outer edge, summary tabs 6px on top, controls 4px.
    borders: A 1px blue grey sleeve edge with a semicircle thumb notch, 1px rules and a 2px ink header rule.
    shadows: A soft paper shadow under the sheet and tabs, inset shadows in the punched holes and a faint diagonal gloss across sleeves.
    icons:
        Filled sticker shapes in round outlined pills, a dot for On track,
        a triangle for At risk and a square for Behind, plus a clock for
        overdue. Other icons are 2px line icons.
    focus: A 3px office blue outline offset 2px with a 6px white halo.
    tone: Filing language, such as Section 1, sheet 1 of 6 and Activity log.
